Echo Installing the Cedar ColorDisplay controls...Bringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>ColorDisplay.dfRun ColorDisplay.loadEcho Turning the colour display on...ColorDisplay onEcho Fetching Gargoyle, Install and HashTable...Bringover [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Gargoyle.dfBringover [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Install.DFBringover [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>HashTable.dfBringover [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>PopUpMenus.dfBringover [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>SlackProcess.dfBringover [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>TiogaButtons.dfEcho Loading HashTable, then the Install command Gargoyle.load needs...Run HashTableImplRun InstallImplEcho Loading Gargoyle, its packages, and the ColorTool...Source Gargoyle.loadEcho Now type  Gargoyle  to open it.